---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { siteConfig } from '../config/site';
---

<Layout
  title="Join the League - Fresh Meat Clinic"
  description="Join Brookings Area Roller Derby. Skaters, referees, and non-skating officials (NSOs) of all experience levels welcome."
>
  <!-- Header Banner -->
  <section class="bg-grunge py-14 border-b-4 border-[#541221]">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <span
        class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-[#3B0B16] text-[#E5A93C] font-heading uppercase text-xs tracking-widest rounded mb-3"
      >
        Recruitment &amp; Clinics
      </span>
      <h1 class="font-heading text-5xl sm:text-7xl uppercase tracking-wider text-white">
        Join the Pack / Fresh Meat
      </h1>
      <p class="text-gray-400 text-lg max-w-2xl mt-2">
        Whether you've never worn skates or you're a seasoned skater looking for a new league, we
        have a place for you.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-14 space-y-16">
    <!-- Roles Breakdown -->
    <div>
      <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-12">
        <h2 class="font-heading text-4xl sm:text-5xl uppercase tracking-wider text-white mb-3">
          Find Your Role in BARD
        </h2>
        <p class="text-gray-400 text-base">
          Roller derby takes a full village of athletes and officials. Explore how you can
          participate.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
        <!-- Skaters -->
        <div
          class="bg-[#1B1B1B] border-2 border-[#541221] p-8 rounded-xl flex flex-col justify-between shadow-xl"
        >
          <div>
            <div
              class="w-12 h-12 bg-[#3B0B16] text-[#E5A93C] rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center font-heading text-2xl mb-6"
            >
              01
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-heading text-3xl text-white uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">
              Adult Skaters (18+)
            </h3>
            <p class="text-xs uppercase font-subheading text-[#E5A93C] mb-4">
              Adult Division • Full Contact
            </p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
              Train in skating posture, pack strategy, hitting, stopping, and apex jumps. We guide
              you through safety benchmarks step-by-step until you're ready for inter-league bouts.
            </p>
            <ul class="space-y-1.5 text-xs text-gray-400 mb-6">
              <li>✓ No prior skating experience required</li>
              <li>✓ Loaner safety pads and skates available</li>
              <li>✓ Practice 2x weekly at Outdoor Adventure Center</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <span
            class="text-xs font-heading uppercase text-gray-400 block pt-4 border-t border-[#282828]"
            >All Body Types &amp; Fitness Levels Welcome</span
          >
        </div>

        <!-- Juniors Referral -->
        <div
          class="bg-[#1B1B1B] border-2 border-[#541221] p-8 rounded-xl flex flex-col justify-between shadow-xl"
        >
          <div>
            <div
              class="w-12 h-12 bg-[#3B0B16] text-[#E5A93C] rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center font-heading text-2xl mb-6"
            >
              02
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-heading text-3xl text-white uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">
              Junior Derby (Youth)
            </h3>
            <p class="text-xs uppercase font-subheading text-[#E5A93C] mb-4">
              JRDA Program • SoDAK Attack
            </p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
              BARD does not run an in-house junior league, but we proudly support youth derby
              through <strong>SoDAK Attack</strong>, a JRDA junior roller derby program based in
              Sioux Falls, SD. An active group of Brookings-area juniors carpool and commute
              together every week!
            </p>
            <ul class="space-y-1.5 text-xs text-gray-400 mb-6">
              <li>✓ Junior Roller Derby Association (JRDA) league</li>
              <li>✓ Open to youth skaters ages 8–17 of all skill levels</li>
              <li>✓ Active Brookings carpool &amp; commuter network</li>
              <li class="pt-2">
                <a
                  href="https://www.facebook.com/SiouxFallsJuniorRollerDerby"
                  target="_blank"
                  rel="noopener noreferrer"
                  class="text-[#E5A93C] hover:underline font-bold inline-flex items-center gap-1"
                >
                  Visit Sioux Falls Junior Roller Derby on Facebook &rarr;
                </a>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <span
            class="text-xs font-heading uppercase text-gray-400 block pt-4 border-t border-[#282828]"
            >Sioux Falls / Brookings Youth Commuters</span
          >
        </div>

        <!-- Officials -->
        <div
          class="bg-[#1B1B1B] border-2 border-[#541221] p-8 rounded-xl flex flex-col justify-between shadow-xl"
        >
          <div>
            <div
              class="w-12 h-12 bg-[#3B0B16] text-[#E5A93C] rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center font-heading text-2xl mb-6"
            >
              03
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-heading text-3xl text-white uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">
              Refs &amp; NSOs
            </h3>
            <p class="text-xs uppercase font-subheading text-[#E5A93C] mb-4">
              Skating &amp; Non-Skating Officials
            </p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
              Don't want to get tackled, but still want to be in the center of the action? Zebras
              (skating refs) and NSOs (penalty tracking, scoreboard, jam timing) run every game.
            </p>
            <ul class="space-y-1.5 text-xs text-gray-400 mb-6">
              <li>✓ Best seat in the house for every bout</li>
              <li>✓ No dues or equipment fees for officials</li>
              <li>✓ Full training on WFTDA/MRDA rulesets</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <span
            class="text-xs font-heading uppercase text-gray-400 block pt-4 border-t border-[#282828]"
            >Free Admission &amp; Travel Stipends</span
          >
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Inclusivity & Open Gender Policy Statement -->
    <div class="bg-[#3B0B16] border-2 border-[#9E1F3D] rounded-xl p-8 sm:p-10 space-y-4">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-2xl">🏳️‍🌈</span>
        <h3 class="font-heading text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-white uppercase tracking-wider">
          Our Inclusivity &amp; Open Gender Policy
        </h3>
      </div>
      <p class="text-gray-200 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
        Brookings Area Roller Derby is committed to fostering an open, safe, inclusive, and
        empowering sports space. We welcome cisgender women, transgender women, intersex
        individuals, and gender expansive or non-binary participants across our teams. Our
        officiating, coaching, volunteer, and junior support positions are open to individuals of
        all genders. Discrimination, racism, and harassment have zero place on our track.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Contact & Join Options -->
    <div class="bg-[#1B1B1B] border-2 border-[#541221] rounded-2xl p-8 sm:p-12">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-8 text-center">
        <div>
          <span class="text-xs uppercase font-heading tracking-widest text-[#E5A93C] block mb-1"
            >Get Started Today</span
          >
          <h2 class="font-heading text-4xl uppercase tracking-wider text-white">
            Join the Pack / Get in Touch
          </h2>
          <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mt-2 max-w-xl mx-auto">
            The fastest and easiest way to join BARD, ask questions about practice schedules, or
            connect regarding junior carpooling is to message our team directly on Facebook.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-center items-center gap-4 pt-2">
          <a
            href={siteConfig.facebookUrl}
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="px-8 py-4 bg-[#541221] hover:bg-[#7A1A30] text-white font-heading uppercase tracking-wider text-xl rounded-xl shadow-xl border border-[#9E1F3D] transition-transform active:scale-95 flex items-center gap-3"
          >
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 fill-current" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path
                d="M9 8H6v4h3v12h5V12h3.642L18 8h-4V6.333C14 5.374 14.5 5 15.5 5H18V0h-3.808C10.592 0 9 1.582 9 4.615V8z"
              ></path>
            </svg>
            Message Us on Facebook
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-6 border-t border-[#282828] text-xs text-gray-400 max-w-lg mx-auto">
          Whether you're interested in adult skating, officiating (referee/NSO), volunteering at
          bouts, or getting in touch with the Brookings junior derby carpool group for SoDAK Attack,
          reach out to us anytime!
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
